fgrep|fgrep -?|
ascii|none|it takes no options: run it and it prints the table
charcnt|none|it takes no options: name the files to count, and with none it asks for some
dump|dump -?|
file|file -?|
gdd|gdd -?|
strings|strings -?|
tail|tail -?|
wc|none|it takes no options: name the files to count, or give it standard input
wc.cio|none|it takes no options and counts standard input only
sepwords|sepwords -?|
splitalf|splitalf -?|
ape|ape -?|
autolf|autolf -?|
casefix|none|a filter with no options: text on standard input, sentence-cased text out
