valspeak|none|a filter with no options: English on standard input, valley-speak out
gawk|gawk -?|
expand|expand -?|
head|head -?|
split|split -?|
sum|none|it takes no options of its own: name the files to sum
tac|tac -?|
unexpand|unexpand -?|
